Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:02.87,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.78,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Rah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.99,Main,Morse,0,0,0,,We finally meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:17.49,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:20.49,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Your name is Morse now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.92,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Evan Bernstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:27.71,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,It's been ten years, right, Liese?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.67,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,The white lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:41.10,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Whenever you're around, it messes me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.77,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,I can't think about anything but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:47.02,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Your existence alone screws with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:49.04,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,So die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.57,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,You did it to spite me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:56.88,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Pretending to be me and keeping House \NBernstein afloat the last ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.63,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,That's not true, Evan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:00:59.27,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.79,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,I'm ending this here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:06.33,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,And then, I shall reach Ākāśa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:12.05,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,For that, I need that Kreuz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:14.09,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.15,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:46.99,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:49.65,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,You really are always,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.50,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,always two steps ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.09,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Maria Bradley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:02:01.70,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Since you are here, may I take that to \Nmean that you have made up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:05.36,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,It's a good opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:06.57,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:08.97,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I'm sure there is much you want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:12.55,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,After that, let Ray White handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.30,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Ray? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.24,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:18.95,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:21.15,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:52.73,Sign_Basic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3}T{\3c&HB3571A&}h{\3c&HB35621&}e{\3c&HB45529&} {\3c&HB45430&}I{\3c&HB55337&}c{\3c&HB5513E&}e{\3c&HB65045&}b{\3c&HB64F4C&}l{\3c&HB74E54&}a{\3c&HB74D5B&}d{\3c&HB84C62&}e {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}S{\c&HB54F25&}o{\c&HB8482F&}r{\c&HBA403A&}c{\c&HBD3944&}e{\c&HBF314F&}r{\c&HC22A59&}e{\c&HC42264&}r\N{\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}Shall {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}R{\c&HB94533&}u{\c&HBE344B&}l{\c&HC42264&}e {\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}the {\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3\c&HFFFFFF&}W{\3c&HB65428&}o{\3c&HB94F3C&}r{\3c&HBD4B51&}l{\3c&HC04665&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.96,ep title,Titl,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)}Episode 12\N{\fscx90}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Unveils Ākāśa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:59.10,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Yes. And you're the current Iceblade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:02.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,And you are the Glutton, Paratrogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:05.35,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,You know me! What an honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.18,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're a sorcerer who eats \Nother sorcerers' engrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.06,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I became certain of that earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:12.70,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,You've got me all worked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:16.07,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,This Iceblade will be the best treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:20.64,Main - Top,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.58,Main - Top,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:24.24,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Can't you be quiet for a bit, \Nyou uncultured swine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:26.61,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,There's something important \NI need to discuss with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.32,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:31.00,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.44,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:34.18,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Lieselotte Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.91,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Or should I say, the \NSorcerer of Fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.38,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Fabrication...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:40.67,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So you set this all up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.91,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I think Lydia and the others \Nhave an inkling already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.68,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I'll keep it brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:49.63,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I am going to make her overheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:52.84,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Then I want you to seal it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.46,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,You already have experience with that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.16,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.39,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:01.06,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can do it, \Nsince you're resonating with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm... resonating with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.94,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,You remember, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:11.21,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,If it is to save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.81,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I am free to use any method necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:17.00,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,That is what my contract with \NBruno Bradley stipulates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:21.63,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Considering the risks,\Nyou don't seem very concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.88,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I've got my own objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:27.09,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,And for that, I didn't have the \Nluxury of dismissing any option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:29.90,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,My apologies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.33,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,but would you mind taking \Ncare of that loud buffoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:36.34,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Rah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.31,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,You're pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:44.48,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock, release.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.65,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:53.87,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,I'm going to eat up every last part of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.59,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,So you can readjust on the spot, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.22,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect anything less.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.81,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Liese...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.77,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Evan, you get it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:26.06,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,You cannot reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:27.95,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.83,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.37,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,About Eugenics...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:32.42,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,About Ākāśa...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:33.58,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,About the Kreuz...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:37.59,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,As long as I get to kill \Nyou with these hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.47,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,It seems my voice doesn't reach you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:45.83,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Dark Triad System, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.25,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,I know all about that, Evan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:53.10,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,A forbidden technique that \Nstimulates the brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.49,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,thereby amplifying a human's dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:07:01.47,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,The engram temporarily grows \Nand causes an overheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:05.77,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.02,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.65,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Prima materia encoding;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:15.29,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,material code, material code, decoding,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.73,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,material code, processing, synesthesia,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.03,Main - Top,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,embodiment, phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:18.67,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Apotheosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:28.80,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,The destructive factor I possess is \Nmaking your engram self-destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:31.33,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,It's over, Evan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:36.92,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Liese!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:46.16,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,Is this... the power of the strongest...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:49.57,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,The Sorcerer of Fabrication?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.00,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.80,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,The strongest is the Iceblade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:56.78,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Ray White is of another caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:59.82,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,He exists in a whole different\Ndimension, you could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.71,Main,Evan,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:05.46,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Suppose there was a sorcerer who \Ncould rule the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:09.69,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,The only one who could do that... is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.53,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:17.01,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,The Iceblade Sorcerer shall rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:20.02,Sign_Basic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3}T{\3c&HB3571A&}h{\3c&HB35621&}e{\3c&HB45529&} {\3c&HB45430&}I{\3c&HB55337&}c{\3c&HB5513E&}e{\3c&HB65045&}b{\3c&HB64F4C&}l{\3c&HB74E54&}a{\3c&HB74D5B&}d{\3c&HB84C62&}e {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}S{\c&HB54F25&}o{\c&HB8482F&}r{\c&HBA403A&}c{\c&HBD3944&}e{\c&HBF314F&}r{\c&HC22A59&}e{\c&HC42264&}r\N{\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}Shall {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}R{\c&HB94533&}u{\c&HBE344B&}l{\c&HC42264&}e {\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}the {\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3\c&HFFFFFF&}W{\3c&HB65428&}o{\3c&HB94F3C&}r{\3c&HBD4B51&}l{\3c&HC04665&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.79,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Is it all... over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:28.56,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.48,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:34.93,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Even though we couldn't do a single \Nthing in the Kafka Forest exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.41,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,That shows how far all of us have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.58,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,And all because of Ray, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.47,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:43.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,We'd never have come this \Nfar if it wasn't for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:46.57,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Especially you, Albert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:47.50,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:48.69,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.59,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.81,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.71,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,The same thing as in Kafka Forest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.40,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:03.04,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:06.99,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:10.64,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,You all did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.83,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Sorry we kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:16.37,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,You were fighting in your outfits, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:19.30,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,You're getting top points for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:20.78,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,We'll be taking it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.62,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Let's get rid of the last ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:27.46,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,The last ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:28.19,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:29.47,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:32.80,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,These guys were actually all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:36.56,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Streams of men who hit on you \Nand bugs are so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.60,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,So ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.28,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Those seven grand sorcerers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:47.06,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:49.49,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.60,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Carocaro isn't a guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:52.54,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:09:59.86,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,Flash of Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:07.05,Main,Carla,0,0,0,,That one is called Lightning Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.50,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Febris Draco!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:20.75,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Yamata Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:28.75,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Is that for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.33,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:31.38,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,So it's real, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.37,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:36.02,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Can't be losing to my students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.03,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Carol in Wonderland,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.70,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Through the Looking Glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:42.54,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.76,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,We've finally reached the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:52.11,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,I'm really sad that I have \Nto say goodbye today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:56.96,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,but Carocaro promises to not forget \Nall my fans until the day I forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:01.36,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Now, please listen to my last song!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:02.09,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Loud-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:06.85,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Kyapi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:09.36,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,What do they mean by "the end"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.15,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,You all better get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.10,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Icicle Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:15.73,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ragnarok!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:20.96,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Eat this supreme sorcery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:28.72,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Jeez. Talk about overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:32.19,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Lydia, you're as violent as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:33.16,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it from you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:36.37,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,I did properly take the surrounding \Narea into consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.95,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,As if, you arsonist...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.50,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,My stage appearance was so moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:39.58,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:40.68,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I have no words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.67,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:44.26,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,So, Elisa, why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:46.49,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Lydia's live sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:48.81,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,As an Ainser, I've been so blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:50.50,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.36,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Now it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.81,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Is this all the Iceblade can do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.30,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.56,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Come at me in earnest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:02.47,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Then I won't hold back anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:04.40,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,This is my full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:09.20,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,My original spell that provides \Nthe ultimate body enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:15.28,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Man-eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:18.99,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.83,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,This is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:22.77,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:26.73,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,This is all because you couldn't \Nopen your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.11,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,The fact that Ray's in that situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:32.40,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,that I'm like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.03,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,this entire situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:36.88,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,All because you never talk \Nabout the important things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:46.49,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,I think it's time to eat you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:51.83,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:59.42,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,I'm going to savor you, Iceblade!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.01,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Prima materia, encoding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:01.97,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,material code, decoding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.12,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,processing, deceleration,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:03.29,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:04.10,Main - Top,Ray,0,0,0,,restoration, compression,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:04.50,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,embodiment, picnogram,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:05.31,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,material.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.45,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:08.75,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,You want me to crush that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:12.85,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:14.31,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.52,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,That really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.87,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.28,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,It didn't break?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.86,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's over, Paratrogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Pandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:37.90,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:42.14,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Now I understand what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:46.64,Main,Paratrogo,0,0,0,,Iceblade, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:55.65,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:13:59.87,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.37,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Maria...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:04.55,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Let me go. I need to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.16,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,I told you this is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:08.69,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,That's like you, always \Nplaying the good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.03,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,You have it so easy, \Nnot knowing how others feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.82,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.58,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,You stay quiet and look sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.91,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,then everybody around you gets you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:19.14,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.13,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:27.53,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You have no idea what I've been through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:31.30,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I've suffered so much for you, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.44,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.55,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,You just did that on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.55,0:14:38.23,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,I never asked you for any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.80,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Because you're always so needlessly caring,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:44.31,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,I always get compared to \Nmy wonderful older sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:46.44,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,And I'm just the failure of a sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:51.72,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to always bear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.44,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Now, and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:54.76,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:57.51,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,If you're going to be mopey because \Nyou pity me, just cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:58.20,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,It's annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.41,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.65,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.55,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's why I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:05.51,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:08.14,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Pretending to be some heroine in a drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:11.03,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You rebel against our parents \Nand do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.84,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I despise you so much, Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:16.29,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Then just say so from the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:17.94,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,That I should disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.78,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,That you don't need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.95,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,That you wish I'd never been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.33,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:31.69,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I've never wished you hadn't been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.67,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,There're things I don't like about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:36.58,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,but you are my precious little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.16,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:43.98,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:49.31,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:57.36,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Big Sister! Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:58.93,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Maria...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:01.34,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.85,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Was he important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:19.84,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:23.08,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,He was seduced by a demon and got jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:25.09,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,He had thrown away his humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:26.63,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,A foolish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:31.39,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Things don't go the way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:33.67,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,In reality, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.09,Main,Lieselotte,0,0,0,,Hurry. Go to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:41.72,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:42.74,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.02,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.97,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,The overheating is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:56.14,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Maria, stand back and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:59.04,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Please help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:16:59.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:02.98,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Rebecca...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:10.40,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray, I said such horrible things to Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:13.96,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You must be so disillusioned with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:14.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:20.19,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Nobody is free of conflict or worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.64,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I have so much respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:25.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:27.63,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Maria loves you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.38,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.67,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.47,Main,Bruno,0,0,0,,So both my daughters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:10.09,Main,Bruno,0,0,0,,Rebecca and Maria, are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:10.90,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:14.48,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,The Iceblade, Ray, was the one who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:18.51,Main,Bruno,0,0,0,,Could you please convey to him my gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.14,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:33.59,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Sorry it's me, and not Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.24,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:40.00,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,But it's almost time for me and Ray to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:40.64,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:43.72,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Wow, you two sure are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:45.56,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.48,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I'm still not on the same level as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:51.63,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no need for modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:55.94,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we plan on \Nspending the night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:56.37,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.35,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're just watching fireworks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.35,0:18:59.48,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:02.34,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I need to properly thank him for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:05.97,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I... I showed him my gratitude, \Ntoo, after the Magic Chevalier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:09.93,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,And he held me tight and he told me \Nhe wanted us to always be together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:11.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:14.50,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds like a \Nwonderful friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:17.59,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,But my life is now forever tied to his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:21.06,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be incorrect to say that \Nour souls are bound to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.70,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're going to have a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.18,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray is very popular with girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.07,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:27.65,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,And I do have the capacity \Nto accept that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.24,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,In the end, love always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.36,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.00,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:42.07,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You might not think it, but I hate losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.13,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Why do you two get to have all the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:47.94,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:49.30,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:54.16,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I do have the capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.79,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.92,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:00.70,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:01.72,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:02.57,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.64,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:17.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm a student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:18.80,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Can you even imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.65,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Me, a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:25.10,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,After having taken so \Nmany lives in the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:28.50,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I never thought I would \Nhave the right to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:32.38,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,After I lost you back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.32,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I felt so adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:39.76,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I was so stained in blood that I had \Nno idea where I could ever fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:45.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,And it was my master \Nwho showed me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:52.34,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The world that was normal to me was \Ncompletely detached from the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:54.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Even then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:57.68,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,there were many people who were willing \Nto accept someone like me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.09,0:21:01.19,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Howard,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:05.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I have friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:11.20,Sign_Basic,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Amelia Rose\N{\fs26}Saeki Iori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.71,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Rebecca Bradley\N{\fs26}Waki Azumi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:15.74,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,You can be happy now, Lydia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:18.21,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Elisa Griffith \N{\fs26}Harumura Nana
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:18.20,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Ray you wanted to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.57,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:21.71,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Claris Cleveland \N{\fs26}Hondo Kaede
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.61,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Lydia's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.22,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Evi Armstrong \N{\fs26}Umehara Yūichirō
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.21,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,So are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:27.42,Main,Carol,0,0,0,,Lydia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.72,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Abbie Garnet \N{\fs26}Mori Nanako
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.35,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Dumbpink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:32.22,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Carol Caroline \N{\fs26}Uchida Maaya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:34.12,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:35.73,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Lydia Ainsworth \N{\fs26}Tanezaki Atsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:41.23,Main,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\fs18}Ray White \N{\fs26}Enoki Junya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.43,Main,Abbie,0,0,0,,Man, what a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.91,Main,Ariane,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:49.29,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Ariane?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:53.49,Main,Ariane,0,0,0,,I want you to enter the Magicks War with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The Magicks War?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.11,0:23:48.94,Main,Stella,0,0,0,,This is so boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:52.46,Main,Stella,0,0,0,,I hope my big brother comes home soon.
